{"symbol":"ULM.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:58:24Z","info":{"address1":"Koszajec 50","city":"Brwinów","zip":"05-840","country":"Poland","phone":"48 22 506 7040","fax":"48 22 814 3131","website":"https://www.ulmaconstruction.pl","industry":"Rental & Leasing Services","industryKey":"rental-leasing-services","industryDisp":"Rental & Leasing Services","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"ULMA Construccion Polska S.A. provides formwork and scaffolding solutions and services in Poland and internationally. The company rents and sells scaffoldings systems, which include frame and ringlock scaffolding for use in restoration, industrial, and construction sites; formwork systems, including wall, column, slab, climbing, tunnel, and bridge formwork; safety equipment; timber beams and plywood; and shoring systems. It offers construction services; and logistics, engineering and applications, onsite assistance, and equipment pre-assembly services; and ULMA Studio and Scaffmax scaffolding design software. The company was formerly known as BAUMA S.A. and changed its name to ULMA Construccion Polska S.A. in November 2006. The company was founded in 1961 and is headquartered in Brwinów, Poland. ULMA Construccion Polska S.A. is a subsidiary of ULMA C y E, S. Coop.","fullTimeEmployees":435,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Rodolfo Carlos Muñiz Urdampilleta","title":"President of the Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Magdalena  Predota","title":"CFO & Member of Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Marek  Czuprynski","title":"MD, Logistics Director & Member of the Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Giordano Marcel Weschenfelder","age":48,"title":"Member of Management Board","yearBorn":1977,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Jacek  Kuczews